# Server backups live here. NOTHING in this directory may ever be committed.
#
# Two reasons, both load-bearing:
#   1. This repo is PUBLIC on GitHub, and vfi-config-*.tgz contains backend/.env
#      — the APP_KEY, the database password and the mail credentials.
#   2. The repo root IS the web root on the VPS, so a committed dump would be
#      downloadable at http://<host>/res/<file> the moment it deployed.
#
# Ignore everything except this file.
*
!.gitignore
